  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组为所有森林生物群系添加了多种不同的遗迹。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/133/ruin4.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/130/ruin1.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/132/ruin3.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1197/134/ruin5.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>隐藏的宝藏</strong>：某些遗迹中藏有秘密宝箱</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>欢迎在您的整合包中使用本模组</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>也请查看沙漠遗迹模组：</strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1312/228/big-ruin.png\" width=\"385\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-ruins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/desert-ruins</a></span></p>",
